{
  "_note": "生成器 tools/infosource/gen_releases.py。`xJob/new.xjob` 的判定段:按 tag 去重、首跑只建基线、不补报。状态(每个仓库上次看到的版本)只写在这里,取数段 xWidget/flow/board.df 与组件共用、不写状态。",
  "version": 1,
  "actions": [
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "jin0",
        "value": "${j0}"
      },
      "_note": "入参落地(勿删):方法参数里的 ${} 看不见 flow 入参。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "jf0",
        "value": "$[split::(${jin0},~)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "P0",
        "value": {
          "cn": "$[toLowerCase::(findNotEmpty::(index::(${jf0},0),-))]",
          "nm": "$[index::(split::(findNotEmpty::(index::(${jf0},0),-),/),1)]",
          "tg": "$[findNotEmpty::(index::(${jf0},1),)]",
          "ms": "$[findNotEmpty::(index::(${jf0},2),0)]",
          "ok": "$[findNotEmpty::(index::(${jf0},3),0)]"
        }
      },
      "_note": "拆「正名~tag~毫秒~取到了没有」;没关注的槽入参是 `-`,正名落成 `-`。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "kn0",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${P0.ok},1),1,0)]"
      },
      "_note": "知道这个仓库此刻的状态 = 取到了 feed。一个 tag 都没有的仓库也算「知道」,基线记成 `~0` ——这样它发第一个版本时照样会报(否则那一轮才第一次有基线,首个版本就被当成基线吞掉)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "ht0",
        "value": "$[if::(gt::(length::(${P0.tg}),0),1,0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "sk0",
        "value": "$[connect::(rl.last.,${P0.cn})]"
      },
      "_note": "基线键拼上仓库正名:同一轮里 8 个仓库挨个判,共用一个键会互相顶掉基线。"
    },
    {
      "id": "pv0",
      "action": "data.get",
      "params": {
        "key": "${sk0}",
        "default": ""
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_b0",
        "value": "1"
      },
      "_note": "⚠️ 请求/并发屏障(勿删):request 与 concurrent 之后**紧邻**的节点读不到响应(晚一拍合并,memory [[actionflow-concurrent-late-merge]])。删掉它 → 下面所有 index:: 静默取空 → 卡渲一片 `--`,而流仍报 success。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "pr0",
        "value": "${pv0}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "pp0",
        "value": "$[split::(${pr0},~)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "hp0",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${pr0},__none__),__none__),0,1)]"
      },
      "_note": "有没有基线。判空用 findNotEmpty 哨兵(length:: 对数字恒 0)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "same0",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(connect::(k,${P0.tg}),connect::(k,findNotEmpty::(index::(${pp0},0),))),1,0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "later0",
        "value": "$[if::(gt::(${P0.ms},findNotEmpty::(index::(${pp0},1),0)),1,0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "hit0",
        "value": "$[if::(and::(eq::(${kn0},1),eq::(${ht0},1),eq::(${hp0},1),eq::(${same0},0),eq::(${later0},1)),1,0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "if",
      "props": {
        "val": "$[eq::(${kn0},1)]"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "action": "data.set",
          "params": {
            "key": "${sk0}",
            "value": "${P0.tg}~${P0.ms}"
          }
        }
      ],
      "_note": "只在「知道」时写基线;取不到的这一轮什么都不动。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "pc0",
        "value": "${P0.nm} ${P0.tg}"
      },
      "_note": "通知正文里的一段:「uv 0.12.20」。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "cand0",
        "value": "${pc0}"
      },
      "_note": "正文 = 命中的「仓库 版本」用 · 连起来。模板串内插(中间的空格活得下来),connect:: 会吃掉分隔符两侧的空格。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "acc",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${hit0},1),${cand0},)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "jin1",
        "value": "${j1}"
      }
    },
